cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the MIME-ViT paper listed under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: MIME-ViT
abstract: >-
  MIME-ViT (Multiscale Image Morphological Extraction Vision Transformer) is a
  hybrid deep learning architecture that combines Vision Transformer and CNN
  branches to capture multiscale morphological features of breast lesions in
  mammograms. It processes image patches at multiple scales (512x512, 256x256,
  64x64, 16x16) to extract both macroscale and microscale features for breast
  cancer detection.
